// One agent-actionable line per capability added in each SKILL version. On a
// skill_version transition, the delta is surfaced ONCE as a `whats_new`
// needs_attention item — the `update` block only says "re-install"; this is
// what names the new verbs. Add an entry here on EVERY version bump (part of
